# Microcanonical relaxation of a periodic fcc copper crystal after a heat pulse.
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.615
region crystal block 0 ${cells} 0 ${cells} 0 ${cells} units lattice
create_box 1 crystal
create_atoms 1 box

pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ${potential}
velocity all create 900.0 54973 mom yes dist gaussian loop geom
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

fix integrate all nve
timestep 0.002
thermo ${sample_every}
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe etotal press
thermo_modify norm no lost error flush yes format float %.15g
run ${steps}
